    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: Miss Margaret, the lady of my heart, was the hardest of all. She had to
    be dismembered right in the cemetery... On the same day I took the liver from
    the second lady; luckily she was lighter and it didn't cause me any problems.
    And the most surprising thing is that the head of this stupid barmaid Lucy turned
    out to be the lightest; although what's surprising about that, hehe.
--- !u!222 &929484375
CanvasRenderer:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
